# TBCGuide - Night Elf start: Shadowglen and Teldrassil (1-11)
# Copyright (C) 2026 GREYsaurus (https://github.com/GREYsaurus) - GPL-3.0-only. Original route and notes.

@guide A_NightElf_Teldrassil
@name Shadowglen & Teldrassil
@faction Alliance
@races NightElf
@levels 1-11
@zone Teldrassil
@chapter Azeroth
@start
@desc Night elf starting route. Shadowglen to about level 5, then Dolanaar, the Ban'ethil Barrow Den, Lake Al'Ameth and the Oracle Glade. Ends with the flight to Auberdine for Darkshore.
@next A_Darkshore

accept 456 The Balance of Nature | Conservator Ilthalaine, in front of Aldrassil.
accept The Woodland Protector | Melithar Staghelm.
complete 456 The Balance of Nature | Young Nightsabers and Young Thistle Boars.
turnin The Woodland Protector | Tarindrella in the glade.
accept 459 The Woodland Protector
turnin 456 The Balance of Nature
accept 3116 Simple Sigil [class=Warrior] | Conservator Ilthalaine gives your class sigil now.
accept 3117 Etched Sigil [class=Hunter]
accept 3118 Encrypted Sigil [class=Rogue]
accept 3119 Hallowed Sigil [class=Priest]
accept 3120 Verdant Sigil [class=Druid]
accept 457 The Balance of Nature
accept Webwood Venom | Gilshalan Windwalker, inside Aldrassil.
accept A Good Friend | Dirania Silvershine.
complete 459 The Woodland Protector | Grells around the glade drop Fel Moss.
turnin 459 The Woodland Protector
complete 457 The Balance of Nature | Mangy Nightsabers and Thistle Boars.
turnin 457 The Balance of Nature
turnin A Good Friend | Iverron, north near the spider cave.
accept A Friend in Need
complete Webwood Venom | Webwood Spiders in Shadowthread Cave.
turnin A Friend in Need
accept 3521 Iverron's Antidote
complete 3521 Iverron's Antidote | Hyacinth Mushrooms on the ground, Moonpetal Lilies at the pool, Webwood Ichor from spiders.
turnin 3521 Iverron's Antidote
turnin Webwood Venom
accept Webwood Egg
complete Webwood Egg | The egg is at the back of Shadowthread Cave.
turnin Webwood Egg
accept Tenaron's Summons
turnin Tenaron's Summons | Top of Aldrassil.
accept 921 Crown of the Earth
complete 921 Crown of the Earth | Fill the phial at the moonwell north of Aldrassil.
turnin 921 Crown of the Earth
accept 928 Crown of the Earth
turnin 3116 Simple Sigil [class=Warrior] | Your class trainer in Aldrassil.
turnin 3117 Etched Sigil [class=Hunter]
turnin 3118 Encrypted Sigil [class=Rogue]
turnin 3119 Hallowed Sigil [class=Priest]
turnin 3120 Verdant Sigil [class=Druid]
train | Your trainer is inside Aldrassil.
accept Dolanaar Delivery | Porthannius on the path out of Shadowglen.
turnin Dolanaar Delivery | Innkeeper Keldamyr, Dolanaar.
bind Dolanaar
turnin 928 Crown of the Earth | Corithras Moonrage, Dolanaar.
accept 929 Crown of the Earth
accept Zenn's Bidding | Zenn Foulhoof, by the river east of Dolanaar.
accept A Troubling Breeze | Athridas Bearmantle, Dolanaar.
accept Denalan's Earth | Syral Bladeleaf.
accept Elixirs for the Bladeleafs
accept Twisted Hatred | Tallonkai Swiftroot.
accept Recipe of the Kaldorei | Zarrin.
turnin Denalan's Earth | Denalan at Lake Al'Ameth, south of Dolanaar.
accept Timberling Seeds
accept Timberling Sprouts
complete Timberling Seeds | Timberlings around the lake.
complete Timberling Sprouts | Sprouts on the ground around the lake.
turnin Timberling Seeds
turnin Timberling Sprouts
complete Zenn's Bidding | Nightsabers, Webwood Lurkers and Strigid Owls around Dolanaar.
complete Recipe of the Kaldorei | Webwood Lurkers drop Small Spider Legs.
complete Elixirs for the Bladeleafs | Moonpetal Lilies.
turnin A Troubling Breeze | Gaerolas Talvethren, top of the hill east of Dolanaar.
accept Gnarlpine Corruption
turnin Gnarlpine Corruption
accept The Relics of Wakening
complete 929 Crown of the Earth | Fill the phial at the Starbreeze Village moonwell.
complete Twisted Hatred | Lord Melenas in Fel Rock, near Dolanaar.
turnin Zenn's Bidding
turnin Recipe of the Kaldorei
turnin Elixirs for the Bladeleafs
turnin Twisted Hatred
turnin 929 Crown of the Earth
accept 933 Crown of the Earth
complete The Relics of Wakening | Ban'ethil Barrow Den, north of Dolanaar.
turnin The Relics of Wakening
accept Ursal the Mauler
complete 933 Crown of the Earth | The Pools of Arlithrien moonwell, south-west.
complete Ursal the Mauler | Gnarlpine camp south-east of Lake Al'Ameth.
turnin Ursal the Mauler
turnin 933 Crown of the Earth
accept 7383 Crown of the Earth
complete 7383 Crown of the Earth | The Oracle Glade moonwell in the north-west.
turnin 7383 Crown of the Earth
accept 935 Crown of the Earth
accept The Road to Darnassus [optional] | Moon Priestess Amara patrols the road.
complete The Road to Darnassus [optional] | Gnarlpine Ambushers along the road west of Dolanaar.
turnin The Road to Darnassus [optional]
turnin 935 Crown of the Earth
train | Darnassus trainers (Warrior's Terrace, Cenarion Enclave).
fp Rut'theran Village
note Take the portal in Darnassus down to Rut'theran Village, then fly to Auberdine (Darkshore).
fly Auberdine
